---
module: pong
func_id: ball
---

***conformance tests***

# ball-starts-in-the-center
When the game starts, a square ball is shown in the center of the screen.

# ball-moves-after-the-start
One second after the game starts, the ball is no longer in the center of the screen.

# ball-stays-between-the-top-and-the-bottom
During 10 seconds of play without either :Paddle: moving, the ball is never drawn above the top edge or below the bottom edge of the playfield.

***acceptance tests***
